// An executable at optimization level 2 keeps no call paths: a panic names the function it
// is in. `build::trace_calls{ on = true }` keeps them at that level too, also for the calls
// the C compiler inlines.
//# project
//# $ {fast}
//# panic: {dir}/main.ctx:1:42: panic: index 2 out of bounds for length 2
//# path:
//|   at third ({dir}/main.ctx:1:42)
//# $ {traced}
//# panic: {dir}/main.ctx:1:42: panic: index 2 out of bounds for length 2
//# path:
//|   at third ({dir}/main.ctx:1:42)
//|   at middle ({dir}/main.ctx:3:46)
//|   at main ({dir}/main.ctx:7:18)

